<section id="faq">
<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<FaqItem question="What is the OLSP System exactly?">
<p>The OLSP System is a bundled affiliate-marketing platform that combines training (OLSP Academy), a pre-built sales funnel (Mega Funnel), prospecting tools, and a two-tier commission structure into a single membership. It was created by Wayne Crowe around 2020. Members share a single tracking link (Mega Link), and the system's automated follow-up handles the sales process.</p>
</FaqItem>
<FaqItem question="Is the OLSP System an MLM?">
<p>The OLSP System uses a two-tier commission model — members can earn on direct referrals and also on the purchases made by people their referrals bring in (a downline commission). This structure shares characteristics with multi-level marketing programs, though OLSP's marketing does not describe it as an MLM. We examine this question in detail in our separate article: <a href="/is-olsp-academy-an-mlm/">Is OLSP Academy an MLM?</a></p>
</FaqItem>
<FaqItem question="How much does the OLSP System cost?">
<p>Multiple sources describe a free entry tier with basic access to training and a Mega Link. Paid add-ons include the VIP/Accelerator tier (reported around $97/month), TD Pages for landing page building, traffic packages (solo ads), and prospecting tools. The $7 Megalink offer is a common first-purchase promotion. Verify current pricing directly — offers change frequently.</p>
</FaqItem>
<FaqItem question="Can a complete beginner realistically earn money with the OLSP System?">
<p>It is possible, but we have no independently verified data on what a typical beginner actually earns. The system rewards consistent traffic-driving activity over months, and the highest commission payouts come from referring people who choose to upgrade into paid tiers. Self-reported income updates circulating online are not audited and likely overrepresent active promoters.</p>
</FaqItem>
<FaqItem question="Is the OLSP System the same as OLSP Academy?">
<p>Not exactly. OLSP Academy is the training and onboarding layer within the wider OLSP System — the Bootcamp lessons, live calls, and community. The OLSP System includes the Academy plus the Mega Link, Mega Funnel, prospecting tools, traffic packages, and the commission structure. For a full walkthrough of the Academy specifically, see our <a href="/reviews/olsp-academy/">full OLSP Academy review</a>.</p>
</FaqItem>
<FaqItem question="Who created the OLSP System?">
<p>Wayne Crowe is the individual most consistently credited as the creator, describing himself publicly as having worked in online marketing for around 15 years. One third-party source attributed the system to a different person, which we could not reconcile.</p>
</FaqItem>
</section>

